WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.000
Every job starts with good intentions.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.000
A quote, a handshake, a start date.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:13.100
But when plans change, or something goes wrong, it quickly becomes your word against theirs.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.600
TradeResolve keeps you both on the same page, from day one.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.800
Before work starts, you both sign one simple Unified Agreement.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.200
The job, the price and the payment stages, all in writing.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:32.800
Fill it in together, or start it yourself, and we'll send the other person a secure link.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.600
Your shared job file keeps everything in one place.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.100
Add photos and updates as you go, and agree any changes with a tick from both of you.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.800
Nothing can be deleted, so the record stays true.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.300
If a problem comes up, either of you can raise it.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:55.300
We guide you both through fair, simple steps, with seven days to respond at each stage.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:56.700
Still stuck?

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:05.200
An independent Master Assessor, an experienced tradesperson, inspects the work and gives you both the same written findings.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.700
Fair to the customer. Fair to the tradesperson.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.000
One flat fee for the whole job, from just £49.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.100
TradeResolve. It's got to be right.

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:21.000
Protect your next job at traderesolve.co.uk
